Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.00,0:00:10.00,INTRO,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1500,1500)\move(680,230,610,230)}{\fn@楷体\fs18\frz270}剧情简介 京香 饰 华姐
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.00,0:00:20.00,INTRO,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1500,1500)\move(680,230,610,230)}{\fn@楷体\fs18\frz270}一位美丽的单亲妈妈 华姐
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.00,0:00:30.00,INTRO,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1500,1500)\move(680,230,610,230)}{\fn@楷体\fs18\frz270}调教成巨乳奴隶\N\N被阿峰从最初的高贵\N\N
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.00,0:02:16.00,INTRO,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1500,1500)\move(680,230,610,230)}{\fn@楷体\fs18\frz270}高贵美丽的华姐登场了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.00,0:02:30.00,INTRO,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1500,1500)\move(680,230,610,230)}{\fn@楷体\fs18\frz270}没有注意到华姐在背后\N\N而被华姐内衣吸引的阿峰\N\N
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.49,0:00:10.28,Default,,0,0,0,,教育朋友的妈妈\N变成乳奴隶
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.85,0:00:21.65,Default,,0,0,0,,广治
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.20,0:00:25.29,Default,,0,0,0,,这边怎么解
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.14,0:00:27.19,Default,,0,0,0,,那边
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.17,0:00:34.50,Default,,0,0,0,,把分子乘上这边\N还有这分母拆开
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.01,0:00:35.94,Default,,0,0,0,,答案就出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.73,0:00:39.33,Default,,0,0,0,,真不愧是广治\N真厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.78,0:00:40.72,Default,,0,0,0,,哪有啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.15,0:00:44.02,Default,,0,0,0,,之前我刚好解过了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.83,0:00:49.93,Default,,0,0,0,,你之前的IQ测验\N成绩不是很棒吗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.58,0:00:52.94,Default,,0,0,0,,你的头脑比较好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.94,0:00:54.94,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.59,0:00:59.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我借个厕所吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.87,0:01:01.03,Default,,0,0,0,,好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.53,0:01:03.72,Default,,0,0,0,,知道地方吗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.29,0:01:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,楼梯下去 就在旁边
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.62,0:01:11.32,Default,,0,0,0,,借一下
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.49,0:01:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,什么啊 什么鬼问题
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.53,0:01:26.71,Default,,0,0,0,,搞不懂
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.00,0:01:28.90,Default,,0,0,0,,那是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.63,0:01:35.68,Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.14,0:01:40.11,Default,,0,0,0,,内衣
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.89,0:01:43.85,Default,,0,0,0,,华姐的内衣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.59,0:01:46.45,Default,,0,0,0,,好大
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.48,0:01:49.94,Default,,0,0,0,,很香的味道
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.60,0:01:53.39,Default,,0,0,0,,这个杯罩可是相当大啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.41,0:01:59.52,Default,,0,0,0,,他妈妈奶子居然这么大
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.86,0:02:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,好想能玩啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.95,0:02:06.92,Default,,0,0,0,,好大喔
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.43,0:02:09.74,Default,,0,0,0,,想搓揉
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.92,0:02:13.55,Default,,0,0,0,,超大喔
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.98,0:02:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,要是能把华姐抱在怀里玩该多棒啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.56,0:02:24.77,Default,,0,0,0,,好香
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.64,0:02:28.25,Default,,0,0,0,,好喜欢哦
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.94,0:02:31.30,Default,,0,0,0,,阿峰
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.75,0:02:33.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你这是在干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.09,0:02:39.55,Default,,0,0,0,,那个 我想借厕所
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.37,0:02:41.18,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.31,0:02:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,拿那个干嘛啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.81,0:02:50.43,Default,,0,0,0,,没事\N说啊 让我看看
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.20,0:02:58.73,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我的内衣吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.61,0:03:01.23,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么要拿
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.86,0:03:07.34,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉了 掉在这边\N所以我捡起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.29,0:03:12.59,Default,,0,0,0,,应该不是这样吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.40,0:03:17.65,Default,,0,0,0,,拿我的内衣想干嘛啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.54,0:03:21.87,Default,,0,0,0,,那个
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.16,0:03:26.29,Default,,0,0,0,,想着淫荡的事情了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.08,0:03:29.36,Default,,0,0,0,,没有啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.24,0:03:33.75,Default,,0,0,0,,想让广治看看而已
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.41,0:03:36.65,Default,,0,0,0,,不要牵扯到他
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.94,0:03:41.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我要跟你爸妈\N还有学校说喔
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.66,0:03:44.65,Default,,0,0,0,,请不要跟学校说
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.02,0:03:49.31,Default,,0,0,0,,这样大家都会知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.42,0:03:54.06,Default,,0,0,0,,你都这样做了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.59,0:03:57.77,Default,,0,0,0,,请回去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.16,0:03:59.37,Default,,0,0,0,,以后不要来了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.84,0:04:02.77,Default,,0,0,0,,回家吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.59,0:04:05.83,Default,,0,0,0,,等等啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.93,0:04:08.44,Default,,0,0,0,,等等\N妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.11,0:04:10.04,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.33,0:04:13.61,Default,,0,0,0,,没事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.87,0:04:14.81,Default,,0,0,0,,不要在意
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.21,0:04:16.29,Default,,0,0,0,,回去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.29,0:04:19.78,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.06,0:04:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,不要再来了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.11,0:04:27.79,Default,,0,0,0,,他好像突然有事情
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.99,0:04:32.01,Default,,0,0,0,,没事吧\N回房间吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.63,0:05:00.10,Default,,0,0,0,,非常抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.85,0:05:03.93,Default,,0,0,0,,该怎么说
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.90,0:05:06.07,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.23,0:05:10.13,Default,,0,0,0,,上次的事情 非常抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.97,0:05:17.63,Default,,0,0,0,,这个 先起来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.00,0:05:21.03,Default,,0,0,0,,你也到了思春期
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.51,0:05:25.31,Default,,0,0,0,,这也是当然的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.10,0:05:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我原谅你了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.56,0:05:31.53,Default,,0,0,0,,先进来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.85,0:05:32.67,Default,,0,0,0,,真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.84,0:05:34.67,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.68,0:05:45.97,Default,,0,0,0,,去客厅坐一下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.26,0:05:47.98,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 你要干嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.79,0:05:57.14,Default,,0,0,0,,为了得到华姐 我只有这样才能进来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.99,0:05:59.80,Default,,0,0,0,,不是说反省了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.79,0:06:05.03,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 我应该直接得到你 而不是内衣
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.54,0:06:08.84,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么可以这样 不要这样做
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.84,0:06:12.72,Default,,0,0,0,,超棒
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.08,0:06:17.78,Default,,0,0,0,,丁字裤啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.15,0:06:20.10,Default,,0,0,0,,穿这种内裤啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.06,0:06:23.09,Default,,0,0,0,,没错吧 丁字裤
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.38,0:06:27.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我妈妈都没穿这种
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.06,0:06:28.98,Default,,0,0,0,,住手
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.21,0:06:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,,奶子果然好大
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.85,0:06:41.83,Default,,0,0,0,,不能这样啊 快放手
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.16,0:06:45.47,Default,,0,0,0,,请不要这样做
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.81,0:06:50.94,Default,,0,0,0,,刚刚那是淫叫吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.97,0:06:52.82,Default,,0,0,0,,你听错了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.12,0:06:54.76,Default,,0,0,0,,摸得好舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.34,0:07:00.57,Default,,0,0,0,,胸部好大喔
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.99,0:07:02.61,Default,,0,0,0,,说什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.85,0:07:04.35,Default,,0,0,0,,不要太过分
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.38,0:07:06.93,Default,,0,0,0,,让我看看
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.50,0:07:11.12,Default,,0,0,0,,不要啊 放开啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.97,0:07:23.70,Default,,0,0,0,,好美啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.73,0:07:28.14,Default,,0,0,0,,好香的味道
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.96,0:07:33.19,Default,,0,0,0,,不要反抗了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.92,0:07:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,不要这样
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.43,0:07:45.53,Default,,0,0,0,,现在停下来 \N我会原谅你做的事
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.53,0:07:47.96,Default,,0,0,0,,奶子舒服吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.01,0:07:49.67,Default,,0,0,0,,你乱说什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.31,0:08:01.48,Default,,0,0,0,,不要太过分
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.02,0:08:05.32,Default,,0,0,0,,超棒喔
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.84,0:08:09.20,Default,,0,0,0,,华姐好大喔
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.96,0:08:23.86,Default,,0,0,0,,跟我说啊\N什么
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.20,0:08:25.34,Default,,0,0,0,,什么罩杯
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.55,0:08:27.41,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么要说啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.68,0:08:29.07,Default,,0,0,0,,又没关系啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.09,0:08:31.72,Default,,0,0,0,,快点放开
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.44,0:08:48.42,Default,,0,0,0,,诱人的味道啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.57,0:08:50.24,Default,,0,0,0,,说什么啊 快住手
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.37,0:09:13.41,Default,,0,0,0,,住手
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.15,0:09:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,这样是犯法的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.43,0:09:17.93,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.60,0:09:19.47,Default,,0,0,0,,让我看啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.26,0:09:27.85,Default,,0,0,0,,奶头硬了喔
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.43,0:09:30.49,Default,,0,0,0,,哪有啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.89,0:09:32.76,Default,,0,0,0,,很爽的时候 就硬吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.04,0:09:35.14,Default,,0,0,0,,不是 你搞错了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.31,0:09:37.45,Default,,0,0,0,,那我继续弄
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.53,0:09:47.71,Default,,0,0,0,,住手
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.17,0:09:49.70,Default,,0,0,0,,不可以继续了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.61,0:10:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,干嘛啊 知道自己干嘛吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.83,0:10:28.74,Default,,0,0,0,,硬了喔
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.14,0:10:36.16,Default,,0,0,0,,这里好诱人呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.92,0:10:38.93,Default,,0,0,0,,给我看看怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.49,0:10:43.81,Default,,0,0,0,,不行 这里是我的私密处啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.49,0:10:46.35,Default,,0,0,0,,住手 不能碰啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.47,0:10:49.71,Default,,0,0,0,,这里热呼呼的呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.18,0:10:52.31,Default,,0,0,0,,别这样
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.02,0:10:56.38,Default,,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.65,0:11:08.89,Default,,0,0,0,,湿了喔
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.29,0:11:11.81,Default,,0,0,0,,不要继续摸了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.10,0:11:15.80,Default,,0,0,0,,不能再继续了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.86,0:11:20.76,Default,,0,0,0,,这可不行，是不是太爽了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.01,0:11:22.92,Default,,0,0,0,,不是
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.54,0:11:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,很舒服吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.67,0:11:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,,完全没有
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.21,0:11:54.16,Default,,0,0,0,,超棒
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.88,0:11:55.97,Default,,0,0,0,,想舔一下
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.02,0:11:57.30,Default,,0,0,0,,你说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.60,0:12:00.77,Default,,0,0,0,,不要继续了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.94,0:12:12.62,Default,,0,0,0,,好棒啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.50,0:12:22.60,Default,,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.06,0:12:38.81,Default,,0,0,0,,够了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.35,0:12:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,放过我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.89,0:13:11.69,Default,,0,0,0,,不可以这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.93,0:13:15.37,Default,,0,0,0,,不行 我要看小穴
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.29,0:13:29.99,Default,,0,0,0,,来脱掉吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.10,0:13:33.79,Default,,0,0,0,,都脱掉吧\N不行啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.08,0:13:38.82,Default,,0,0,0,,把你的巨乳展现出来
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.04,0:13:42.44,Default,,0,0,0,,给我欣赏
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.51,0:13:48.66,Default,,0,0,0,,知道吗 你这样做是犯罪
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.45,0:14:27.12,Default,,0,0,0,,华姐很享受嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.34,0:14:32.63,Default,,0,0,0,,不要这样弄我了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.70,0:14:35.78,Default,,0,0,0,,这可不行 来和我接吻
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.70,0:15:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,高潮了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.32,0:15:18.17,Default,,0,0,0,,没有 怎么可能
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.62,0:15:24.09,Default,,0,0,0,,华姐不诚实哦 身体明明高潮了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.52,0:15:26.21,Default,,0,0,0,,别在弄了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.12,0:15:31.47,Default,,0,0,0,,快停下啊 不能继续了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.33,0:16:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,不能这样弄小穴啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.63,0:16:10.10,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么不能
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.54,0:16:38.11,Default,,0,0,0,,水好多啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.71,0:16:45.03,Default,,0,0,0,,玩够了吧,可以停下了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.14,0:16:49.10,Default,,0,0,0,,你还要想干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.17,0:16:52.08,Default,,0,0,0,,你说呢，当让是该我爽了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.52,0:17:00.68,Default,,0,0,0,,来吃我肉棒
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.09,0:17:03.09,Default,,0,0,0,,不可以
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.92,0:17:28.66,Default,,0,0,0,,自己主动吃
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.11,0:17:31.39,Default,,0,0,0,,知道这样是犯法吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.68,0:17:32.99,Default,,0,0,0,,会怎样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.03,0:17:36.49,Default,,0,0,0,,你这样是会被抓的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.11,0:17:39.40,Default,,0,0,0,,先乖乖的吃肉棒再说
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.23,0:18:07.56,Default,,0,0,0,,肉棒好吃吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.44,0:18:09.55,Default,,0,0,0,,不可能好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.27,0:18:15.23,Default,,0,0,0,,好吃吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.21,0:18:19.38,Default,,0,0,0,,肉棒全部吃下去
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.36,0:18:41.54,Default,,0,0,0,,不要太过分
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.66,0:18:43.98,Default,,0,0,0,,胸部爽吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.69,0:18:46.69,Default,,0,0,0,,不可能爽
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.76,0:19:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,够了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.21,0:19:09.74,Default,,0,0,0,,满足了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.14,0:19:12.48,Default,,0,0,0,,当然还不够
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.26,0:19:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,说什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.09,0:19:18.12,Default,,0,0,0,,要多爽一点啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.41,0:19:24.90,Default,,0,0,0,,已经够爽了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.97,0:19:27.64,Default,,0,0,0,,可以住手了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.95,0:19:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,,很想要吧\N说什么阿
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.63,0:19:32.65,Default,,0,0,0,,夹着
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.91,0:19:35.24,Default,,0,0,0,,说什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.35,0:19:36.51,Default,,0,0,0,,夹住啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.92,0:19:39.15,Default,,0,0,0,,不夹吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.24,0:19:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,不要乱说
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.31,0:19:42.41,Default,,0,0,0,,夹啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.15,0:19:53.05,Default,,0,0,0,,这样做好 可以放过我了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.50,0:19:57.52,Default,,0,0,0,,很常这样做吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.76,0:19:59.74,Default,,0,0,0,,和你没关系吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.24,0:20:15.01,Default,,0,0,0,,夹得再紧点
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.41,0:21:04.93,Default,,0,0,0,,华姐你的技术好棒呢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.07,0:21:09.08,Default,,0,0,0,,这样是不是可以放过我了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.39,0:21:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,还不够啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.89,0:21:14.65,Default,,0,0,0,,要射精喔
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.98,0:21:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,才会爽
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.00,0:21:32.61,Default,,0,0,0,,那我帮你弄射精
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.22,0:21:45.57,Default,,0,0,0,,然后你就放我过怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.42,0:21:48.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我还要亲华姐小穴
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.40,0:21:49.87,Default,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.03,0:21:52.15,Default,,0,0,0,,华姐 来这样
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.21,0:21:53.55,Default,,0,0,0,,你要做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.78,0:22:00.41,Default,,0,0,0,,你这样 要做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.80,0:22:18.97,Default,,0,0,0,,干嘛啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.99,0:22:21.21,Default,,0,0,0,,不要继续了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.36,0:22:27.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我要操华姐小穴
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.34,0:22:30.05,Default,,0,0,0,,说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.47,0:22:34.90,Default,,0,0,0,,不可以操小穴 你别得寸进尺了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.94,0:22:36.57,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么不能操
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.59,0:22:38.17,Default,,0,0,0,,自己知道吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.21,0:22:40.29,Default,,0,0,0,,你不是要帮我射精吗
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.73,0:22:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,不可以这样
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.71,0:22:50.43,Default,,0,0,0,,住手啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.11,0:23:02.29,Default,,0,0,0,,小穴操起来超爽
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.18,0:23:06.42,Default,,0,0,0,,快停下 不能操我的小穴
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.29,0:23:21.08,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 快停下 停下
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.24,0:23:24.32,Default,,0,0,0,,知道自己干嘛吗
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.57,0:23:34.29,Default,,0,0,0,,别这样 别这么用力操啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.60,0:23:36.45,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 受不了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.83,0:23:39.75,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 我的小穴
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.08,0:24:11.91,Default,,0,0,0,,别这样 我会受不了的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.79,0:24:16.94,Default,,0,0,0,,是不是很爽啊
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.36,0:24:23.94,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么可能 我在被你强暴 怎么可能会爽
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.75,0:24:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,在撒谎吧
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.60,0:24:29.05,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么可能撒谎 根本不爽
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.85,0:24:33.34,Default,,0,0,0,,还是快点承认吧
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.38,0:24:35.15,Default,,0,0,0,,承认什么
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.71,0:25:00.27,Default,,0,0,0,,华姐被操到高潮了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.31,0:25:01.84,Default,,0,0,0,,没有这事
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.22,0:25:04.70,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 是吗 那我们来接着操
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.25,0:25:07.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我会把你操得非常爽
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.29,0:25:09.68,Default,,0,0,0,,不可能啊
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.39,0:25:28.41,Default,,0,0,0,,不能在继续操我了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.43,0:25:30.61,Default,,0,0,0,,快停下啊
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.78,0:25:33.21,Default,,0,0,0,,是不是很爽
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.73,0:26:03.88,Default,,0,0,0,,住手啊
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.68,0:26:45.83,Default,,0,0,0,,是不是爽的高潮了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.11,0:26:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,没有 没有高潮
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.26,0:26:50.92,Default,,0,0,0,,诚实一点嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.87,0:26:58.45,Default,,0,0,0,,那我们接着操
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.62,0:27:00.86,Default,,0,0,0,,你够了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.16,0:27:07.97,Default,,0,0,0,,别再操我小穴了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.88,0:27:45.38,Default,,0,0,0,,求你不要再操我了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.94,0:27:51.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我快要不行了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.06,0:28:24.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我已经被你操得没力气了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.04,0:28:37.68,Default,,0,0,0,,华姐喜欢被我操吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.31,0:28:41.14,Default,,0,0,0,,可以停了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.16,0:28:43.77,Default,,0,0,0,,操了我这么久 应该满足了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.08,0:29:12.48,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 别这么用力啊
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.02,0:29:35.42,Default,,0,0,0,,华姐 爽吗
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.54,0:29:41.35,Default,,0,0,0,,不可能爽啊 被你强暴怎么会爽啊
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.17,0:30:21.30,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 我又要来了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.64,0:30:30.47,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 忍不住了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.98,0:30:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,华姐 你不用忍
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.39,0:30:39.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我们来一起高潮
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.66,0:30:44.79,Default,,0,0,0,,要射精了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.82,0:30:48.11,Default,,0,0,0,,不行 不能在小穴里射精
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.39,0:30:50.39,Default,,0,0,0,,不要射里面 求你了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.44,0:30:54.56,Default,,0,0,0,,不要射里面啊 你听懂了没有
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.55,0:31:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,阿峰 你为什么要这样对我
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.26,0:31:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,,以后 你不许再来我家
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.46,0:31:32.92,Default,,0,0,0,,今天的事也绝对不能说出去
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.53,0:31:36.77,Default,,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.52,0:31:42.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你在过做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.98,0:31:46.89,Default,,0,0,0,,拍照做个纪念
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.01,0:31:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,,还给我 不可以拍这个照
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.18,0:31:52.73,Default,,0,0,0,,你要照片干嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.83,0:31:54.02,Default,,0,0,0,,当然是有用啊
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.07,0:32:00.09,Default,,0,0,0,,给我 快点删除 这样是不对的 知道吗
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.77,0:32:04.35,Default,,0,0,0,,佑治
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.22,0:32:06.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我到家了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.91,0:32:08.91,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 欢迎回家
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.50,0:32:24.38,Default,,0,0,0,,咦 阿峰 你有事吗
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.46,0:32:29.16,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 我是来找你妈妈聊点事情
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.38,0:32:31.53,Default,,0,0,0,,这样喔
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.70,0:32:35.48,Default,,0,0,0,,妈妈 我可以和阿峰玩吧
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.83,0:32:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.37,0:32:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,,但是他要走了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.80,0:32:45.92,Default,,0,0,0,,今天谢谢了 先走了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.13,0:32:48.95,Default,,0,0,0,,下次见\N下次见
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.03,0:33:43.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么能进我家
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.02,0:33:47.86,Default,,0,0,0,,这是 快给我 把照片删除啊
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.69,0:33:52.88,Default,,0,0,0,,这个可不能删
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.09,0:33:55.79,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么 快删掉啊
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.63,0:34:01.02,Default,,0,0,0,,你是怎么进入我家的 门锁了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.98,0:34:05.17,Default,,0,0,0,,从广治那边抢来钥匙
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.30,0:34:06.27,Default,,0,0,0,,广治吗
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.84,0:34:07.86,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.41,0:34:11.36,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么\N没关系吧
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.45,0:34:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我想华姐了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.33,0:34:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,不要摸 快点删除
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.78,0:34:19.40,Default,,0,0,0,,这样可以吗
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.67,0:34:22.13,Default,,0,0,0,,如果外面人知道了照片的事
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.76,0:34:24.41,Default,,0,0,0,,广治会怎样呢
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.96,0:34:26.43,Default,,0,0,0,,想干嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.46,0:34:31.43,Default,,0,0,0,,还不是因为华姐好多天不理我了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.95,0:34:35.57,Default,,0,0,0,,你强暴了我 我为什么还要理你
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.64,0:34:38.74,Default,,0,0,0,,那把照片给大家看看
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.84,0:34:41.26,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道会怎样喔
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.32,0:34:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,传给广治看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.18,0:34:47.03,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么能这样 不要牵扯他
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.33,0:34:48.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你有什么要求
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.10,0:34:52.40,Default,,0,0,0,,那就做我的巨乳性奴隶 如何
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.87,0:35:00.31,Default,,0,0,0,,华姐 只要乖乖听我话就行
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.21,0:35:08.32,Default,,0,0,0,,这样很爽吧
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.57,0:35:09.83,Default,,0,0,0,,说什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.77,0:35:15.18,Default,,0,0,0,,不要接近广治喔
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.41,0:35:19.70,Default,,0,0,0,,他在学校朋友很少喔
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.14,0:35:23.78,Default,,0,0,0,,所以会寂寞吧
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.72,0:35:25.68,Default,,0,0,0,,那个
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.38,0:35:28.27,Default,,0,0,0,,没错吧
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.86,0:35:30.31,Default,,0,0,0,,这是为了广治好
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.71,0:35:39.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我喜欢看AV
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.87,0:35:46.21,Default,,0,0,0,,AV里面不是有洗身体吗\N洗身体吗
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.70,0:35:47.55,Default,,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.37,0:35:52.06,Default,,0,0,0,,用胸部洗身体
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.67,0:35:53.52,Default,,0,0,0,,那是什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.09,0:35:55.34,Default,,0,0,0,,用看看啊
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.95,0:35:58.25,Default,,0,0,0,,说什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.76,0:36:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,没关系吧
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.92,0:36:01.81,Default,,0,0,0,,这边
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.72,0:36:17.06,Default,,0,0,0,,弄点泡沫
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.02,0:36:21.57,Default,,0,0,0,,用胸部洗喔
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.23,0:36:24.47,Default,,0,0,0,,胸部
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.67,0:36:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.35,0:36:31.34,Default,,0,0,0,,用胸部洗身体
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.92,0:36:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,,叫我做吗
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.69,0:36:38.66,Default,,0,0,0,,不要吗
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.07,0:36:42.05,Default,,0,0,0,,也可以不要喔
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.31,0:36:45.48,Default,,0,0,0,,要做吗
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.62,0:36:52.51,Default,,0,0,0,,知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.89,0:36:57.19,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.25,0:37:02.24,Default,,0,0,0,,好了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.83,0:37:10.98,Default,,0,0,0,,这样吗
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.17,0:37:13.32,Default,,0,0,0,,可以吧
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.70,0:37:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,,再来啊
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.04,0:37:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,好爽喔
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.16,0:37:31.85,Default,,0,0,0,,真厉害啊
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.11,0:37:33.24,Default,,0,0,0,,说什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.27,0:37:38.17,Default,,0,0,0,,这个结束之后\N不要再接近我们家
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.67,0:37:41.14,Default,,0,0,0,,说好了喔
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.89,0:37:51.75,Default,,0,0,0,,多摩擦一点
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.23,0:37:54.33,Default,,0,0,0,,还要吗
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.48,0:37:57.11,Default,,0,0,0,,才刚开始啊
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.42,0:38:03.75,Default,,0,0,0,,要把身体洗干净啊
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.32,0:38:12.84,Default,,0,0,0,,干净了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.92,0:38:16.18,Default,,0,0,0,,还没啊
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.01,0:38:19.01,Default,,0,0,0,,这样洗
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.37,0:38:29.10,Default,,0,0,0,,这样可以了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.42,0:38:32.79,Default,,0,0,0,,再来
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.37,0:38:42.07,Default,,0,0,0,,要洗干净喔
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.70,0:38:55.87,Default,,0,0,0,,这样可以吧
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.30,0:39:04.06,Default,,0,0,0,,多洗一点
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.16,0:39:14.86,Default,,0,0,0,,可以了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.68,0:39:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,被广治知道的话\N会怎样呢
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.16,0:39:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,是你说要做的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.49,0:39:26.47,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我才做的
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.04,0:39:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,如果妳好好做的话
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.41,0:39:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,加油喔
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.23,0:39:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,好像乳头变硬了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.46,0:39:47.54,Default,,0,0,0,,不可能吧
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.13,0:39:49.06,Default,,0,0,0,,真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.51,0:39:52.74,Default,,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.24,0:39:55.39,Default,,0,0,0,,乳头凸起了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.81,0:39:58.15,Default,,0,0,0,,不可能啊
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.01,0:40:05.66,Default,,0,0,0,,换上半身
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.30,0:40:07.20,Default,,0,0,0,,上半身
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.65,0:40:09.72,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 都要洗干净啊
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.19,0:40:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,,胸部好软好爽喔
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.19,0:41:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,被广治看见会怎样呢
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.59,0:41:12.06,Default,,0,0,0,,和他无关
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.56,0:41:16.16,Default,,0,0,0,,要洗快一点喔\N不然他快到家了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.58,0:41:46.38,Default,,0,0,0,,不光只是用胸部\N小穴也要
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.80,0:41:47.95,Default,,0,0,0,,说什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.24,0:41:50.52,Default,,0,0,0,,可以吧
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.79,0:41:55.74,Default,,0,0,0,,这边
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.62,0:42:02.11,Default,,0,0,0,,上来啊
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.23,0:42:17.67,Default,,0,0,0,,都淫叫了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.02,0:42:20.60,Default,,0,0,0,,不可能吧
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.24,0:42:23.26,Default,,0,0,0,,这样摩擦 很爽吗
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.46,0:42:25.40,Default,,0,0,0,,不是
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.51,0:42:31.84,Default,,0,0,0,,真是变态啊
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.50,0:42:53.42,Default,,0,0,0,,够了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.92,0:42:55.16,Default,,0,0,0,,满足了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.06,0:42:59.00,Default,,0,0,0,,还不满足啊
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.42,0:43:01.99,Default,,0,0,0,,要怎样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.43,0:43:06.29,Default,,0,0,0,,要把身体都洗干净啊
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.58,0:43:12.82,Default,,0,0,0,,阿姨知道那个吗
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.26,0:43:14.19,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.92,0:43:16.01,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道吗
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.93,0:43:20.86,Default,,0,0,0,,这样洗
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.41,0:43:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,湿湿的喔
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.35,0:43:49.44,Default,,0,0,0,,不要插入啊
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.45,0:44:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,小穴要洗干净啊
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.85,0:44:23.39,Default,,0,0,0,,弄快一点
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.64,0:44:25.76,Default,,0,0,0,,不要动啊
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.52,0:44:28.39,Default,,0,0,0,,要这样洗
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.53,0:44:53.69,Default,,0,0,0,,不可以啊
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.00,0:44:56.27,Default,,0,0,0,,光自己爽
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.91,0:44:57.87,Default,,0,0,0,,够了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.54,0:45:01.03,Default,,0,0,0,,不可以啊 我也要
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.52,0:45:07.14,Default,,0,0,0,,冲干净 再换胸部吧
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.75,0:45:53.88,Default,,0,0,0,,这样满足了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.63,0:46:02.11,Default,,0,0,0,,阿姨的胸部超爽
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.60,0:46:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.79,0:46:05.87,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下会走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.20,0:46:09.05,Default,,0,0,0,,照片会删掉吧
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.90,0:46:12.31,Default,,0,0,0,,那就多弄一点啊
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.63,0:46:20.01,Default,,0,0,0,,继续喔
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.56,0:46:24.77,Default,,0,0,0,,说好了喔
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.52,0:46:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,不要怀疑我喔
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.64,0:46:29.89,Default,,0,0,0,,说什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.42,0:46:34.83,Default,,0,0,0,,随意拍下照片
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.60,0:46:42.22,Default,,0,0,0,,要快点让我爽喔
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.48,0:46:45.03,Default,,0,0,0,,广治 会到家喔
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.77,0:46:48.07,Default,,0,0,0,,快点射啊
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.74,0:46:52.26,Default,,0,0,0,,不然让广治也一起洗吧
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.66,0:46:54.09,Default,,0,0,0,,不要乱说
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.96,0:46:59.69,Default,,0,0,0,,广治也喜欢这样喔
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.00,0:47:01.68,Default,,0,0,0,,不可能吧
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.81,0:47:03.75,Default,,0,0,0,,真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.57,0:47:11.73,Default,,0,0,0,,帮我舔了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.84,0:47:13.85,Default,,0,0,0,,好温柔喔
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.54,0:47:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,快点回去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.81,0:47:20.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我想要了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.17,0:47:22.32,Default,,0,0,0,,说什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.91,0:47:24.00,Default,,0,0,0,,不可能
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.84,0:47:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,多弄一点啊
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.59,0:47:48.80,Default,,0,0,0,,这样可以吧
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.38,0:47:52.20,Default,,0,0,0,,满足了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.86,0:47:55.52,Default,,0,0,0,,好色喔
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.31,0:48:29.08,Default,,0,0,0,,这样插入着喔
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.89,0:48:34.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是照做
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.09,0:48:38.77,Default,,0,0,0,,但是这样爽吧
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.61,0:48:41.88,Default,,0,0,0,,不可能爽啊
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.61,0:48:47.75,Default,,0,0,0,,超爽啊
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.38,0:48:50.58,Default,,0,0,0,,要射了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.37,0:48:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,射了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.08,0:49:25.89,Default,,0,0,0,,不要再接近我家
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.36,0:49:31.77,Default,,0,0,0,,超爽啊
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.74,0:49:34.10,Default,,0,0,0,,快点回去啊
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.03,0:49:40.26,Default,,0,0,0,,这样洗澡真棒
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.66,0:49:43.13,Default,,0,0,0,,刚刚说过了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.33,0:49:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,只要爽过之后\N就要走了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.86,0:49:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,,有听我说话吗
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.55,0:49:56.47,Default,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.99,0:49:58.18,Default,,0,0,0,,快点走啊
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.52,0:50:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,这样可以吗
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.80,0:50:02.81,Default,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.17,0:50:05.47,Default,,0,0,0,,想要删除照片吧\N是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.77,0:50:09.05,Default,,0,0,0,,但是这种态度不可以吧
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.35,0:50:11.90,Default,,0,0,0,,不可以这样的态度
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.39,0:50:15.01,Default,,0,0,0,,什么啊 刚刚都做了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.80,0:50:18.38,Default,,0,0,0,,这种态度 我不想要删除
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.62,0:50:20.87,Default,,0,0,0,,不是说好了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.50,0:50:25.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我没说会删掉喔
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.79,0:50:27.80,Default,,0,0,0,,不要摸
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.77,0:50:35.41,Default,,0,0,0,,胸部好大 会这样浮动
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.29,0:50:37.22,Default,,0,0,0,,说什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.02,0:50:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,不要摸
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.62,0:50:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,又没关系
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.60,0:50:49.85,Default,,0,0,0,,再一下下
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.60,0:50:52.87,Default,,0,0,0,,太狡猾了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.89,0:50:55.19,Default,,0,0,0,,不是满足了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.81,0:50:59.87,Default,,0,0,0,,只有那样 没有满足啊
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.71,0:51:10.79,Default,,0,0,0,,够了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.01,0:51:15.56,Default,,0,0,0,,又没关系
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.95,0:51:17.07,Default,,0,0,0,,这样玩弄
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.68,0:51:22.52,Default,,0,0,0,,阿姨的胸部真棒
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.29,0:51:26.83,Default,,0,0,0,,快点回家吧
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.44,0:51:30.08,Default,,0,0,0,,好冷淡啊
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.81,0:51:33.93,Default,,0,0,0,,什么冷淡\N要让广治的同学
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.68,0:51:36.69,Default,,0,0,0,,大家都知道吗
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.21,0:51:43.29,Default,,0,0,0,,不想吧\N不是说 不会再接近了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.82,0:51:47.24,Default,,0,0,0,,有吗\N怎么这样
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.53,0:51:50.71,Default,,0,0,0,,不想让广治悲伤吧
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.96,0:51:53.65,Default,,0,0,0,,没错吧
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.29,0:51:55.54,Default,,0,0,0,,他很喜欢我喔
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.95,0:51:57.53,Default,,0,0,0,,不要接近他
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.63,0:52:02.63,Default,,0,0,0,,那就好好听话啊
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.09,0:52:07.01,Default,,0,0,0,,想看这胸部啊
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.43,0:52:23.78,Default,,0,0,0,,乳头硬了喔
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.80,0:52:48.36,Default,,0,0,0,,开始爽了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.35,0:52:50.74,Default,,0,0,0,,不可能吧
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.47,0:52:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,这样呢
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.81,0:52:57.10,Default,,0,0,0,,很爽吧
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.94,0:53:08.71,Default,,0,0,0,,真是敏感啊
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.63,0:53:11.59,Default,,0,0,0,,不要摸啊
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.01,0:53:42.86,Default,,0,0,0,,刚刚都让我爽了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.14,0:53:44.48,Default,,0,0,0,,换我来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.12,0:53:47.11,Default,,0,0,0,,不用了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.30,0:53:52.90,Default,,0,0,0,,不可以啊 要老实一点
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.42,0:54:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,爽吗
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.80,0:54:47.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我都硬了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.05,0:56:14.00,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.00,0:56:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,不要摸啊
Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.65,0:56:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,这样吗
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.11,0:56:27.59,Default,,0,0,0,,湿了吧\N没有
Dialogue: 0,0:57:09.93,0:57:11.77,Default,,0,0,0,,不是说不要摸了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:57:27.17,0:57:28.39,Default,,0,0,0,,不要啊
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.58,0:57:46.47,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了 高潮了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.56,0:57:49.18,Default,,0,0,0,,没错吧
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.58,0:57:50.55,Default,,0,0,0,,没有
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.34,0:57:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,高潮了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.71,0:57:54.66,Default,,0,0,0,,不可能啊
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.52,0:58:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,多服务一点喔
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.56,0:58:12.67,Default,,0,0,0,,不用了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.74,0:59:21.80,Default,,0,0,0,,让我看看
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.81,0:59:41.33,Default,,0,0,0,,够了吧
Dialogue: 0,1:00:57.52,1:00:58.70,Default,,0,0,0,,去了啊
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.50,1:01:21.98,Default,,0,0,0,,让我爽吧
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.15,1:01:23.27,Default,,0,0,0,,懂吧
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.47,1:01:42.51,Default,,0,0,0,,这边也舔吧
Dialogue: 0,1:02:05.66,1:02:06.64,Default,,0,0,0,,超爽啊
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.15,1:02:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,,肉棒爽吧
Dialogue: 0,1:02:53.83,1:02:54.74,Default,,0,0,0,,不可能啊
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.59,1:02:59.10,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么淫叫了啊
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.33,1:03:01.33,Default,,0,0,0,,那是
Dialogue: 0,1:03:02.65,1:03:04.24,Default,,0,0,0,,说啊
Dialogue: 0,1:03:05.71,1:03:07.57,Default,,0,0,0,,不用了
Dialogue: 0,1:03:09.63,1:03:10.67,Default,,0,0,0,,回答啊
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.04,1:03:33.36,Default,,0,0,0,,都是硬的喔
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.39,1:03:40.99,Default,,0,0,0,,喜欢这样吧
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.57,1:03:45.41,Default,,0,0,0,,够了吧
Dialogue: 0,1:03:46.53,1:03:47.51,Default,,0,0,0,,回去吧
Dialogue: 0,1:04:40.29,1:04:41.97,Default,,0,0,0,,再来啊
Dialogue: 0,1:04:43.19,1:04:44.24,Default,,0,0,0,,深一点
Dialogue: 0,1:04:57.99,1:04:59.32,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么放开
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.34,1:05:01.89,Default,,0,0,0,,好好含着吧
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.27,1:05:05.66,Default,,0,0,0,,深一点啊
Dialogue: 0,1:05:06.40,1:05:07.62,Default,,0,0,0,,自己来啊
Dialogue: 0,1:05:21.53,1:05:22.90,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么要放开
Dialogue: 0,1:05:24.28,1:05:26.11,Default,,0,0,0,,要被大家知道吗
Dialogue: 0,1:05:29.80,1:05:30.75,Default,,0,0,0,,不要吧
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.77,1:05:40.21,Default,,0,0,0,,小穴想要了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.40,1:05:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,说什么啊
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.05,1:05:47.57,Default,,0,0,0,,满足了吧 回家吧
Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.88,1:05:49.32,Default,,0,0,0,,转到后面
Dialogue: 0,1:05:51.15,1:05:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,这样就好
Dialogue: 0,1:05:55.47,1:05:57.16,Default,,0,0,0,,这样吗
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.82,1:06:02.84,Default,,0,0,0,,会删除吧
Dialogue: 0,1:06:03.14,1:06:05.44,Default,,0,0,0,,之后不要接近我们家
Dialogue: 0,1:06:34.32,1:06:35.33,Default,,0,0,0,,超棒
Dialogue: 0,1:06:38.33,1:06:39.91,Default,,0,0,0,,里面超爽
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.37,1:07:12.31,Default,,0,0,0,,爽吗
Dialogue: 0,1:07:15.56,1:07:17.07,Default,,0,0,0,,说啊
Dialogue: 0,1:07:54.98,1:07:56.21,Default,,0,0,0,,脚抬高
Dialogue: 0,1:08:38.84,1:08:40.28,Default,,0,0,0,,高潮了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:08:42.61,1:08:44.18,Default,,0,0,0,,没有啊
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.12,1:08:46.07,Default,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,1:08:48.93,1:08:50.64,Default,,0,0,0,,广治会怎样呢
Dialogue: 0,1:08:54.78,1:08:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,,不想被知道吧
Dialogue: 0,1:09:30.43,1:09:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,超棒
Dialogue: 0,1:09:32.65,1:09:33.68,Default,,0,0,0,,超爽
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.93,1:09:39.99,Default,,0,0,0,,多动一点吧
Dialogue: 0,1:10:01.76,1:10:02.93,Default,,0,0,0,,一直动喔
Dialogue: 0,1:11:15.95,1:11:17.32,Default,,0,0,0,,说啊 爽吗
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.76,1:11:21.24,Default,,0,0,0,,一点都不爽
Dialogue: 0,1:11:23.01,1:11:24.00,Default,,0,0,0,,这样爽吧
Dialogue: 0,1:12:17.86,1:12:18.94,Default,,0,0,0,,还不够吧
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.89,1:12:55.89,Default,,0,0,0,,老实说啊
Dialogue: 0,1:12:58.71,1:13:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,这样爽吧
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.85,1:13:06.19,Default,,0,0,0,,说看看啊
Dialogue: 0,1:13:07.31,1:13:08.73,Default,,0,0,0,,不然不删除喔
Dialogue: 0,1:13:12.35,1:13:13.36,Default,,0,0,0,,老实说啊
Dialogue: 0,1:14:00.54,1:14:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,可以射吧
Dialogue: 0,1:14:03.75,1:14:06.38,Default,,0,0,0,,不可以 不要内射
Dialogue: 0,1:14:08.49,1:14:11.38,Default,,0,0,0,,什么\N不要内射
Dialogue: 0,1:15:51.87,1:15:53.16,Default,,0,0,0,,说啊 叫我射
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.55,1:15:55.89,Default,,0,0,0,,那个
Dialogue: 0,1:16:00.15,1:16:01.60,Default,,0,0,0,,说看看啊
Dialogue: 0,1:16:18.12,1:16:19.44,Default,,0,0,0,,想要内射吧
Dialogue: 0,1:16:22.34,1:16:24.49,Default,,0,0,0,,不要内射
Dialogue: 0,1:16:53.81,1:16:55.87,Default,,0,0,0,,没有射 就不会结束喔
Dialogue: 0,1:16:57.14,1:16:59.21,Default,,0,0,0,,不要内射啊
